    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Brady is delighted to present this bright and spacious five-bedroom detached property to the market. Extending to approximately 148 sq. m. (1,593 sq. ft.), this modern family home offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is ideally situated in the sought-after village of Termonfeckin.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, bright living room, kitchen/dining room, downstairs WC, five bedrooms with the main bedroom benefiting from an ensuite, and a family bathroom.\n\nThe property is ideally located within easy walking distance of Termonfeckin village and its range of local amenities, while the M1 motorway is approximately a 10-minute drive away, providing excellent access to Dublin and Belfast.\n\nTermonfeckin is a highly regarded coastal village, renowned for its attractive village setting and proximity to some of the area's finest amenities. Golf enthusiasts are particularly well catered for, with both Seapoint Golf Club and County Louth Golf Club at Baltray located nearby. The area offers an excellent balance of peaceful village living while remaining within easy reach of larger urban centres.\n\nDrogheda town is approximately 8 km away, offering an extensive range of shopping, dining, leisure and recreational facilities, as well as excellent transport links. The Enterprise train service from Drogheda provides a direct connection to Dublin city centre, while Dublin Airport can be reached in approximately 35 minutes via the M1. Belfast City Airport is also accessible in under an hour.\n\nThis property would make an ideal family home for those seeking space, convenience and a relaxed village lifestyle, while remaining within easy commuting distance of Dublin and Belfast.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
